<http://data.silknow.org/object/77c7204e-37fb-302d-9412-1a2b67e545e1>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of broceded silk, lined with block-printed cotton, France, 1775-1780"@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded green silk with leaves and stems to groups of flowers growing from a tree-trunk which springs from a bizarre form. The pattern is brocaded in yellow, white, pink and green silk bound in 3/1 twill. Width of the silk between the selvedges is 21.5 inches. Lined with French block-printed cotton of ca. 1775 in two shades of madder purple and pink, with added blue on a white ground. There are three not quite parallel thin meandering stems of flowers in the width of the cotton at 29.5 inches."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c379775a-7daf-3eab-a372-221061d47ef9> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/b8338039-621b-3908-942f-ae62e64ea16e> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of broceded silk, lined with block-printed cotton, France, 1775-1780"@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded green silk with leaves and stems to groups of flowers growing from a tree-trunk which springs from a bizarre form. The pattern is brocaded in yellow, white, pink and green silk bound in 3/1 twill. Width of the silk between the selvedges is 21.5 inches. Lined with French block-printed cotton of ca. 1775 in two shades of madder purple and pink, with added blue on a white ground. There are three not quite parallel thin meandering stems of flowers in the width of the cotton at 29.5 inches."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/77c7204e-37fb-302d-9412-1a2b67e545e1/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/77c7204e-37fb-302d-9412-1a2b67e545e1/dimension/2> ;
